# GitHub Linguist Language Override
# Force GitHub Repository Primary Language display to Python

# Treat React/TypeScript frontend, node_modules, and web assets as vendored/documentation
src/** linguist-vendored
src/**/* linguist-vendored
dist/** linguist-vendored
server.ts linguist-vendored
vite.config.ts linguist-vendored
tsconfig.json linguist-documentation
package.json linguist-documentation
package-lock.json linguist-vendored
index.html linguist-documentation
render.yaml linguist-documentation
*.tsx linguist-vendored
*.ts linguist-vendored
*.css linguist-vendored
*.json linguist-documentation

# Mark Python files as primary code for GitHub statistics
*.py linguist-detectable=true linguist-language=Python
python-backend/*.py linguist-detectable=true linguist-language=Python
